rem Red, Green or Blue Tiles
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=116
rem Count the ways to replace grey
rem squares in a row by tiles of one
rem colour, using at least one tile

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Size integer = 50

rem K tiles of length T can sit in
rem C(Size - K (T - 1), K) ways. Sum
rem over K from 1 and over the three
rem lengths.
Cnt = Size // 2
Tiles = (2 to 4 array) reshape 3 1
Ks = (1 to Cnt array) reshape 1 Cnt
Pool' = Size - Ks * (Tiles - 1)
Fits = Ks * Tiles at most Size
Safe' = Fits choose Pool Ks
Ways' = Safe Ks binomial
Answer = (Fits choose Ways 0) sum
Answer print
